OL,3,GNEWSA'One of a kind' market trader
OL,4,Acelebrates milestone
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman celebrating her 90th birthday
OL,7,Fsays she has no plans to retire as she
OL,8,Fcontinues to run a city market's
OL,9,Flongest-running stall.
OL,11,FKaren Stear has worked at St Nicholas
OL,12,FMarket in Bristol since 1981, running
OL,13,Fthe family business Grandma's Toy Shop.
OL,15,FStear first launched the stall by
OL,16,Fhiring a "couple of tables" where she
OL,17,Fsold model soldiers. More than 40 years
OL,18,Flater, she has watched her customers
OL,19,Fgrow up, become adults and return with
OL,20,Ftheir own kids.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
