OL,3,GNEWSA'One of a kind' market trader
OL,4,Acelebrates milestone
OL,5,
OL,6,FGemma Stear described her grandmother
OL,7,Fas "one of a kind", and praised her for
OL,8,Fnever appearing tired at the end of her
OL,9,Fshift.
